 accommodations for relatives are not directly related to student amenities.', 'Based on the available information, the specific amenities and facilities for student use in the MSG dormitory are not detailed. The only information given is that relatives can be accommodated in guest rooms for short periods (at least 2 days) and parents can stay for any duration, with a document confirming the degree of kinship required. Additionally, students have 24-hour access to the dormitory.', 'No, there are no recreational facilities or common areas specifically designated for students in the MSG dormitory.', 'Students living in the MSG dormitory have 24-hour access and can host relatives in guest rooms for at least a 2-day stay, with parents able to apply for longer periods; however, the degree of kinship must be confirmed by a document.'])
